flowchart LR
  U([Your message]) --> R[Find what to remember<br/>embeddings]
  R --> P[Build the prompt<br/>instructions, memory,<br/>recent history, question]
  P --> M{{Model provider<br/>prefix cache?}}
  M -->|asks for a tool| T[Tool call<br/>tool cache?]
  T --> M
  M --> A([Answer])
  A -.-> C[Later, off the clock:<br/>update memory or summary]
